{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905430/extras/1a8f3253683d1bd750e918c6380fd5c2.avif?t=1773643309\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u201cWhat should I wear today? It's up to you.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every click and keystroke will contribute to the unlocking of her massive wardrobe and enjoy endless outfits! From playful and cute to elegant and dazzling, every new set is a delightful surprise. Though she\u2019ll never admit it\u2026 deep down she loves when you watch her in a new outfit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905430/extras/aff8c05ffbe874a8371b6c6dfcd8a205.poster.avif?t=1773643309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905430/extras/aff8c05ffbe874a8371b6c6dfcd8a205.webm?t=1773643309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905430/extras/aff8c05ffbe874a8371b6c6dfcd8a205.mp4?t=1773643309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905430/extras/88fe5fc168ecd9298050746f664a5722.avif?t=1773643309\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if she\u2019s only in the corner of your screen, she\u2019ll stick to you wherever you go. Place her anywhere you want \u2014 front, back, or side profile \u2014 resize or move her freely. Whether she\u2019s sweet and playful or calm and elegant, she\u2019s always ready to brighten your day. With her around, you\u2019ll never be alone.\u2764</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905430/extras/a11b22e0f39b088d0d2f6f236efde033.poster.avif?t=1773643309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905430/extras/a11b22e0f39b088d0d2f6f236efde033.webm?t=1773643309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905430/extras/a11b22e0f39b088d0d2f6f236efde033.mp4?t=1773643309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905430/extras/7f49762804d958c29461ac0e734b3539.avif?t=1773643309\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She remembers your preferences \u2014 the next time you start up, she\u2019ll appear exactly the way you love most. More than just a desktop companion, she\u2019s your personal, affectionate little companion, always surprising you in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905430?t=1773643309","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905430?t=1773643309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905430/8f33a292d4b43978351f084ce31c03415daef49c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773643309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905430/8f33a292d4b43978351f084ce31c03415daef49c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773643309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game does not involve sex